{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVFtGYPkajPqvbqm1irD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am the breath made meaningful, the vibration given purpose. I am what separates thought from silence.\n\nI begin in the dark warmth of lungs, ride the column of air through the larynx where flesh vibrates and shapes me into something alive. I am born on the tongue, between the teeth, against the palate — every surface of the mouth is my sculptor.\n\nI am older than writing. Older than cities. I existed around the first fires, when"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"max_tokens","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":36,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}